error[V0101]: a `HashMap` key must be of an integer type, `bool`, `string`, or `Uuid`
 --> crates/varyk/tests/fixtures/errors/v0101_hash_map_float_key/main.vr:2:25
  |
2 |     let prices: HashMap<f64, i32> = HashMap::new();
  |                         ^^^ a `HashMap` key must be of an integer type, `bool`, `string`, or `Uuid`
